@startuml
title HybridRagProcessor Workflow

participant "RagNode" as RagNode
participant "HybridRagProcessor" as Hybrid
participant "检索系统" as Retrieval
participant "LLM" as LLM

RagNode -> Hybrid : process(query)
Hybrid -> Hybrid : 前处理 (查询优化、扩展等)
Hybrid -> Retrieval : 混合检索
Retrieval --> Hybrid : 返回检索结果
Hybrid -> Hybrid : 后处理 (结果重排序、过滤等)
Hybrid -> LLM : 结合检索结果生成回答
LLM --> Hybrid : 返回生成结果
Hybrid --> RagNode : 返回最终结果

@enduml
